cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Numerical validation for "Learning Weighted First-Order Rules under
  Piecewise-Linear Lukasiewicz Energies"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below and also cite the
  accompanying manuscript.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Enrico
    family-names: Zanardo
    affiliation: >-
      Signum Magnum College, Portomaso, Malta; Universitas Mercatorum, Rome,
      Italy
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2552-4559
  - given-names: Maria Alessandra
    family-names: Ragusa
    affiliation: >-
      Universita degli Studi di Catania, Catania, Italy; Faculty of Fundamental
