repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/enricozanardo/Learning-Weighted-First-Order-Rules-Lukasiewicz-Energies
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility script for the seeded synthetic validation accompanying the
  manuscript on template-based structure learning and residual/sigmoid weight
  optimisation under Lukasiewicz fuzzy semantics.  Pedagogical arithmetic,
  multi-seed Monte Carlo discrimination, closed-form versus projected gradient
  descent checks, and margin histograms.  Standard library only; runs in well
  under one second on a single CPU core.
keywords:
  - Lukasiewicz logic
  - Markov logic networks
  - structure learning
  - weight learning
  - neuro-symbolic AI
  - reproducibility
